    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūshoka Misili hangī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ī nzala yalī ītaalī ng'halī ū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū aho bamala ī shilīwa īsho baalī benha kūfuma Misili, ū saabo ūbawīla, “Jagi ko hangī mukatūsumīle shilīwa nūūlū shigehu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yuda ūng'wīla, “Ū munhū ng'wenūyo akatūkomeleja no, alīhaya gīkī, ‘Nūūlū kūnibona ū būshū bone dūhū yaya, numho mubize mulī nang'hwe ū nzuna wing'we.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūlū ūlīzunya tūje nang'hwe ū nzuna wise, tūkūja tūkakūgūlīle ī shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ītī chene, nū kūja tūtūjaga ko, nguno ū munhū ng'wenūyo walī atamelanaga aho alītūwīla gīkī, ‘Nūūlū kūnibona ū būshū bone dūhū yaya, numho mubize mulī nang'hwe ū nzuna wing'we.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Isilaeli ūbabūja, “Nibūlī mukang'wīla ū munhū ng'wenūyo gīkī mulī na nzuna wing'we ūngī, nose ng'wanīītīlile makoye mataale chenīkī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo būnshokeja, “Ū munhū ng'wenūyo watūbūjaga mabūjo gatī na wiligīle. Watūbūjaga a bise benekīlī ūmo tūlī, nī ya kū kaya kūūnū; gīkī, ‘Ū sīng'we ataalī alīho mpanga?’ Na gīkī, ‘Mulī na ng'wana wa ng'wing'we ūngī?’ A bise twanshokejaga dūhū gīt'umo watūbūgījaga; ī gīsī lūūlū, ni tūdeebe ginehe gīkī akūnoga nose atūwīle na gīkī, ‘Jagi mukang'wenhe ū nzuna wing'we?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yuda ūng'wīla ū ise ū Isilaeli gīkī, “Ntūūlage mu nkono gwane ū nyanda tūje, tūtizūnanula banhū, twikale bapanga a bose, ū bebe na bise, hamò na a baana bise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nene ng'wenekīlī naliyeega kūlwa nguno yakwe, ūlū ūgwīlwa mhayo gwabūbi gose gose nilīlīīlage nene. Ūlū nūlemeelwa kūng'wenha kwiza kūntūūla mu nkono gwako hangī, ū nene hū nakūbūbūūcha ū būbi wenūbo ū kū būtongi wako shikū jose ja būlamu bone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūlū ni ītī kwigedya gedya, ī haha ni twashikije nūūlū ng'hangala ibīlī tūkūjaga twakashoka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū saabo ūbawīla, “Na lūūlū ūlū gūtī na wiligīle ū gwenūyū, nahene ītagi gīkī, Tūūlagi ū mu magūnīla ging'we shikolo shimò na shimò sha mu sī yise; musolanye ī shawiza wiza, muntwalīle kanong'ho ū munhū ng'wenūyo, maguta ga mitī ya kūūnū, būūkī, shisanjo sha mu shilīwa, ngazu, ngubaalū, na lozi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lozi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Matwajo ga ntī gwa mulozi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī hela mubūūche ningī, jikīle ng'hangala ibīlī a hela ījo ng'walī ng'wasola ī kwandya. Nguno īng'wigeleelilwe kūjishosha ī hela ījo mukatūūlīlwa mu magūnīla ging'we aho mukaja ī kwandya; īkī hamo jikatūūlwa mo bo kūhūbīlwa dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsolagi nū nzuna wing'we muje wangū ū kūlī munhū ng'wenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu ū wa būdūla bose, ang'winhe kūchīlwa shigongo ū kū būtongi bokwe ū munhū ng'wenūyo; alanzunīlīje nū ng'wana wa ng'wing'we ū ūngī, hamò nū Benjamini, ng'wize nabo kaya. Ī yene ūlū gūlīho gwa kūchīlwa, ū nene ni nachīlagwe dūhū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a banhū benabo būshisola ī shikolo īsho batwalaga gītī manong'ho, būsola nī hela ningī ho, ja kūshika ng'hangala ibīlī a ha hela ī ja kwandya; hamò nū Benjamini. Būbūūka bajile; bihuuta ko ī Misili būūkashika biyoolecha ū kūlī Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu aho wamona ū Benjamini alī hamò nabo, ūng'wīla ū ntūmami wa kū ng'wakwe gīkī, “Batwalage kaya a banhū benaba, ūkasīnze ntugo gwawiza, ūtūbeegeje shilīwa, bakūlya hamò nane ī sha līīmi ī lelo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo wīta gīt'umo akawīlīlwa nū Yosefu, ūbatwala a banhū benabo ū kū ng'wa Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho batwalwa ū kū kaya ya ng'wa Yosefu bakogoha no, nguno biganikaga gīkī, “Twenhwa aha kūlwa nguno ya hela ījo jikatūūlwa mu magūnīla gise ī kwandya. Alītogwa tūbize tūtī na mbika yose yose ya kwigunaanīla, nguno alī na ng'hūmbū ja kūtūdima atūtūūle mu būsese, nī nzobe jise jibize jakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būng'wegeela ū ntūmami wa ha ng'wa Yosefu walī ha nyango; būng'wīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Baba tūkiza nī kwandya ū kūūnū kūgūla shilīwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alīyo ū mu nzīla aho tūjile kaya twahayūshika ha ng'hambī ya kūlaala, tūtaligūla ī miligo; tūjibona ī hela jise jilīmo jitang'anhīlile. Jalī jitungilwe jūtūūlwa būlī ng'wene ng'wigūnīla lyakwe, kwegeela higūlya a ha nomo gwalyo; na lūūlū twajenhanījaga najo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twenhaga na hela jingī ja kūgūla shilīwa, tūtamanile hīmba nani akatūshokeja ī hela jise ū mu magūnīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbashokeja, “Ū gwenūyo gwa mhola gūtizūmukoya, ū Mulungu wing'we na Mulungu wa ng'wa sīng'we, h'ūyo akang'winha ī sabo īyo mukīpandīkīla mu miligo ying'we yenīyo; ī hela jing'we naajanukūla nene.” Hūna ūng'wenha ū Simioni wisangīja nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ū ntūmami ng'wenūyo ūbingīja mu numba ya ng'wa Yosefu, ūkabinha minzī ga kooja mhambala; nī nzobe jabo ūjinha shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būshitaligūla na kūshibeeja beeja ī shikolo īsho baalī benha kūlw'inong'ho lya kūng'winha Yosefu. Hūna būnindīīla gīkī ūlū alize ī līīmi bang'winhe; nguno baalī bigwa gīkī ī sha līīmi bakūlīīla henaho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosefu kūlya na bang'wawe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
