          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu aho wingīla ū mu numba, binama ū kū būtongi bokwe kūshisha ha sī; hūna būng'winha ī linong'ho īlo baalī bang'wenhela, nguno baalī nalyo ng'wenūmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbabūgīlīja ī mhola jabo, a boi benekīlī ūmo baalī; hama ūbabūja, “Kinehe ū sīng'we ū namhala ūyo ng'waniwīlaga makanza gene, alī mhola? Ataalī alīho mpanga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo būshosha, “Ū nsese wako ū sīswe ataalī alīho mpanga, nīyo alī mhola no.” Binama hangī ū kū būtongi wakwe kūg'olekeja ikūjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu kūbalola lola gīko, ūnkalalīla no no no ū Benjamini ū nzunaye, ūyo basangīlile nina; hūna ūbūja, “Ūyū hū ng'wene ū nzuna wing'we ū kwangūlīja, ūyo ng'waniwīlaga mhola jakwe?” Kwimanīla wang'wīla, “Mulungu akwītīle yawiza ng'wana wane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu aho wamona ū nzunaye yūbīlīla kūhaya kūlīla ī ng'holò yakwe nguno ya ng'hūmbū; wīnga ho wangū wangū, ūja ipandī lya iyene ūkalīla kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma y'ikanza wiluguta ū būshū, hūna ūshoka watimbyaga ng'holò; ūshikīla kūhaya, “Tengagi ī shilīwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būntengela ī shakwe iyene, nī sha baana ba ng'wawe shūbiza heeke; a Bamisili abo baalī nang'hwe ū ng'wilīīlo, nabo būbiza heeke, nguno a Bamisili batīko kūlya hamò na Bahebulania; ū mhayo gwenūyo ū kū Bamisili gwa malofu no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha kwigasha būhelwa kwandīja wa kwandya kūbyalwa, ūūkamalīīgīja ū kwangū wabo; būyūkumya dūhū kūnū bakwilola lolaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shilīwa bagabūlīlagwa kūfuma a ha meza ya ng'wa Yosefu, ū Benjamini winhwa shingī kūbaheeba a biye ng'hangala itanò. Na lūūlū būyega na kūng'wa hamò nang'hwe mu wiyaabī būtaale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
